{"type":"exercise","type_name":"Exercise","number":"","title":"C1: The reciprocal without strictness","title_html":"C1: The reciprocal without strictness","html":"<p>For a cut <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\alpha > D_0\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6FC TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, let\n<span class=\"math display\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho(\\alpha) \\mathrel{:=} {}& \\{ p \\in \\mathbb{Q} : p \\le 0 \\} \\\\\n{}\\cup{}& \\{ p \\in \\mathbb{Q} : p > 0 \\text{ and } pq \\le 1 \\text{ for\nsome } q \\in \\mathbb{Q} \\setminus \\alpha \\} .\n\\end{aligned}\n\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0;\" class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 23.571em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0; padding-bottom: 0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6FC TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"4\" texclass=\"REL\"><mj